d: #1d4ed8;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 14px 22px;\n    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"announce\">\n  <span class=\"new\">✨ New</span>\n  <span>Insights on the state of AI agents from 800+ builders and leaders. Download your copy →</span>\n  <span class=\"close\">✕</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"navbar\">\n  <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"whale\">🐳</span>dockerdocs</div>\n  <div class=\"navlinks\">\n    <span>Get started</span>\n    <span>Guides</span>\n    <span class=\"active\">Manuals</span>\n    <span>Reference</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"navright\">\n    <div class=\"btn-pill\">🐳 Gordon</div>\n    <div class=\"btn-pill\">🔍 Search</div>\n    <div class=\"btn-sq\">🌙</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"shell\">\n\n  <!-- ================= SIDEBAR ================= -->\n  <nav class=\"sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"sb-group\">AI and Agents</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Overview</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Sandboxes <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">MCP Catalog and Toolkit <span class=\"badge beta\">Beta</span> <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Model Runner <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Gordon <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">AI and Docker Compose <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Agent <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-group\">Application Development</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Desktop <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Engine <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Offload <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Build <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Build Cloud <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Compose <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Extensions <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Deprecated products and features</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Release lifecycle</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-group\">Supply chain security</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Hardened Images <span class=\"badge new\">New</span> <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Hub <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker Scout <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-group\">Platform</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Support</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Billing <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Docker accounts <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Security <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Subscription <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Release notes</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-group\">Enterprise</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Administration <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Deploy Docker Desktop <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item\">Security <span class=\"chev\">⌃</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Add and manage domains</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Single sign-on <span class=\"chev\">⌃</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub2\">Setup</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub2\">Manage connections</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub2 current\">Troubleshoot</div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub2\">FAQs <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Provision <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Enforce sign-in <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Roles and permissions <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Hardened Docker Desktop <span class=\"chev\">⌄</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sb-item sub\">Organization access tokens</div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- ================= MAIN ================= -->\n  <main class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Home</a><span class=\"sep\">/</span><a href=\"#\">Manuals</a><span class=\"sep\">/</span><a href=\"#\">Security</a><span class=\"sep\">/</span><a href=\"#\">Single sign-on</a><span class=\"sep\">/</span>Troubleshoot\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>Troubleshoot single sign-on</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"actionrow\">\n      <div class=\"item\">🐳 Ask Gordon</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">📋 Copy Markdown</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">↗ View Markdown</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>This page describes common single sign-on (SSO) errors and their solutions. Issues can stem from your identity provider (IdP) configuration or Docker settings.</p>\n\n    <h2>Check for errors</h2>\n    <p>If you experience SSO issues, check both Docker and your identity provider for errors first.</p>\n\n    <h3>Check Docker error logs</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Sign in to <a href=\"#\">Docker Home</a> and select your organization from the top-left account drop-down.</li>\n      <li>Select <strong>Admin Console</strong>, then <strong>SSO and SCIM</strong>.</li>\n      <li>In the SSO connections table, select the <strong>Action</strong> menu and then <strong>View error logs</strong>.</li>\n      <li>For more details on specific errors, select <strong>View error details</strong> next to an error message.</li>\n      <li>Note any errors you see on this page for further troubleshooting.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h3>Check identity provider errors</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Review your IdP's logs or audit trails for any failed authentication or provisioning attempts.</li>\n      <li>Confirm that your IdP's SSO settings match the values provided in Docker.</li>\n      <li>If applicable, confirm that you have configured user provisioning correctly and that it is enabled in your IdP.</li>\n      <li>If applicable, verify that your IdP correctly maps Docker's required user attributes.</li>\n      <li>Try provisioning a test user from your IdP and verify if they appear in Docker.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <p>For further troubleshooting, check your IdP's documentation or contact their support team.</p>\n\n    <h2>Groups are not formatted correctly</h2>\n\n    <h3>Error message</h3>\n    <p>When this issue occurs, the following error message is common:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"codeblock\">Some of the groups assigned to the user are not formatted as '&lt;organization <span>[illegible]</span></div>\n\n    <h3>Causes</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Incorrect group name formatting in your identity provider (IdP): Docker requires groups to follow the format <code>&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;</code>. If the groups assigned to a user do not follow this format, they will be ignored.</li>\n      <li>Non-matching groups between IdP and Docker organization: If a group in your IdP does not have a corresponding team in Docker, it will not be recognized, and the user will be placed in the default organization and team.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Affected environments</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Docker single sign-on setup using IdPs such as Okta or Azure AD</li>\n    </ul>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ================= RIGHT TOC ================= -->\n  <aside class=\"toc\">\n    <div class=\"toplink\">✏️ Edit this page</div>\n    <div class=\"toplink\">🚩 Request changes</div>\n\n    <h4>Table of contents</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li class=\"active\">Check for errors</li>\n      <li>Groups are not formatted correctly</li>\n      <li>User is not assigned to the organization</li>\n      <li>IdP-initiated sign in is not enabled for connection</li>\n      <li>Not enough seats in organization</li>\n      <li>Domain is not verified for SSO connection</li>\n      <li>Unable to find session</li>\n      <li>Name ID is not an email address</li>\n    </ul>\n  </aside>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"feedback\">💬 Give feedback</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
